+
+# Hyperliquid
+
+Hyperliquid market data, account history, trade review.
+
+## Skill metadata
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| Source | Optional — install with `hermes skills install official/blockchain/hyperliquid` |
+| Path | `optional-skills/blockchain/hyperliquid` |
